# state: any   (a proof route: it only frames Tron 2.0's Single Player menu; lane.savestate433)
# Tron 2.0: Killer App (42560001) from boot to the Single Player menu, the
# first lines of lane.vcpuwait433's tron-newgame.route (v5), unchanged, then
# stop. `menu-cursor` is the frame that tells the two disk states apart:
# Auto Load and Load Game enabled with a save, greyed with none (tron1,
# route-frame 185013).
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 15
repeat 5 {
    press START
    wait 7
    shot boot-start
}
shot signin
press B
wait 5
shot skip
press START
wait 5
shot menu-start
press A
wait 5
shot menu-a
press START
wait 5
shot menu-start
wait 2
shot menu-cursor
